### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare active memory with pod limits, collection size and indexing activity. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Growing collections, indexing or payload/vector storage exceeding the memory budget.

### Fix
Review indexing and storage options; adjust resource limits only after confirming node capacity.

### Verify
Active memory fits the budget and pods stop restarting or approaching their limits. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
